      "voiceStartFrame": 173,
      "voiceEndFrame": 274
    },
    {
      "id": "scene-3",
      "text": "章节和设定留在你的硬盘。AI 只提交提案，你决定接受、拒绝，还是回滚。",
      "src": "voiceover/manbo/seg-03.mp3",
      "durationSeconds": 6.672000000000001,
      "sceneDurationInFrames": 220,
      "sceneStartFrame": 288,
      "voiceStartFrame": 301,
      "voiceEndFrame": 480
    },
    {
      "id": "scene-4",
      "text": "从规划、写作，到连续性检查、修订和 EPUB 导出，一条工作流写完整部长篇。",
      "src": "voiceover/manbo/seg-04.mp3",
